  "definition": "Storage Requirements",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-05-31",
  "historyNote": "#5734, eff 11-5-93; ss by #6317, eff 8-13-96; ss by #7987, eff 1-3-04, EXPIRED: 1-3-12 New. #10489, INTERIM, eff 12-17-13, EXPIRED: 6-16-14 New. #10712, eff 11-5-14; ss by #13981, eff 5-31-24",
